D. Application: Aeronautics on Mars
There has been recent interest from NASA in sending an aircraft to y in the Martian atmospherein 2005, although ideas about ying in the Martian atmosphere date back at least back to Von Braun.20 Atmospheric density is only 0.017 or 60 times lower than Earth sea level. The only kindness offered to astronauts is that Martian gravity is 3.8 ms¡2, or about three-eighths that of Earth.
